{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Cut 1 — cross-type antisymmetry. %a%=\"10\" (text), %b%=9 (number).\nif %a% > %b% AND if %b% < %a% must both fire (numeric, not lexical). \"5\" == 5 → true.\nProves rank + coercion + dispatch + boundary; catches the antisymmetry bug rank exists to prevent.",
